        "Title": "The Great Kit Kat Heist",
        "Location": "LOCATION_EDGY_FOX",
        "PublicId": "129828900680",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 454d8dc5-6bbf-4ec0-978f-6eee4ed1acb8).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47 you may have seen in the news that a truck containing 400ks, worth of Kit Kats was stolen on route to Poland. \r\rWe have tracked down the hiest crew. They operate out of a club in Berlin. Your mission is to track down the stolen truck and deliver it to the  depo. You need to save Easter, otherwise 1000s of children will go without chocolate this Easter. \r\rWhilst in Berlin  take care of the  hiest  crew, so nothing like this happens again \r\rHappy Easter Everyone. \r\rEnjoy Shrimpy",
